---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const faqSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are DQ fries included with the Chicken Strip Basket?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Every Chicken Strip Basket (4-Piece, 6-Piece, and all Sauced varieties) includes seasoned fries, Texas toast, and a dipping sauce at no extra charge."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are DQ Cheese Curds gluten-free?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "DQ Cheese Curds are battered with a wheat-based coating and are not gluten-free. DQ kitchens also handle other gluten-containing products. If you have celiac disease, check the DQ allergen guide or consult staff."
      }
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Snacks & Sides Menu & Prices 2026 — Fries, Ri..." description="Complete DQ Snacks & Sides menu with 2026 prices. Regular Fries from $2.49, Onion Rings $3.29, Cheese Curds $3.99, Pretzel Sticks with Queso $3.99. Full...">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
<div class="container"><ol>
<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li>
<li aria-current="page">DQ Snacks &amp; Sides Menu 2026</li>
</ol></div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="hero-content">
<span class="hero-eyebrow">Fries · Rings · Curds · Pretzel Sticks</span>
<h1>DQ Snacks &amp; Sides Menu 2026</h1>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Dairy Queen Snacks &amp; Sides — Complete 2026 Guide</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen's Snacks &amp; Sides lineup represents the savory backbone of the <strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill</strong> menu. Far beyond standard fast-food fries, DQ offers unique regional favorites like deep-fried Wisconsin white cheddar cheese curds, soft pretzel sticks with warm queso dip, and thick golden-battered onion rings.</p>
    <p>Whether you are looking to round out a <a href="/items/flamethrower-stackburger">FlameThrower Stackburger</a>, balance a crispy <a href="/items/chicken-strip-basket-4pc">Chicken Strip Basket</a>, or grab a shareable mid-afternoon bite with friends, here is our full breakdown of prices, calories, and deal pairings.</p>

    <h2>2026 Snacks &amp; Sides Menu With Prices &amp; Calories</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Description &amp; Highlights</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$2.49+</td><td>260+</td><td>Crispy golden salted fries (Small, Medium, Large); included with baskets</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/onion-rings">Onion Rings</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.29+</td><td>400+</td><td>Thick-cut sweet whole onions in a crunchy, golden-brown batter</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/cheese-curds">Cheese Curds</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>470</td><td>Real Wisconsin white cheddar curds fried to a stretchy, gooey crisp</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/pretzel-sticks-queso">Pretzel Sticks with Zesty Queso</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>440</td><td>Warm, soft Bavarian-style pretzel sticks with zesty pepper queso dip</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/side-salad">Side Salad</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.29</td><td>90</td><td>Fresh crisp romaine, grape tomatoes, croutons &amp; dressing (lightest side)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Crispy Chicken Strips Salad Bowl</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$9.49</td><td>470</td><td>Entrée salad with chopped crispy chicken tenders, shredded cheddar &amp; dressing</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Applesauce</strong></td><td class="price-cell">Included</td><td>50</td><td>No-sugar-added smooth applesauce cup for Kids Meals</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Smart Ordering &amp; Value Strategies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Best Value Standalone:</strong> <a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries</a> ($2.49) deliver maximum potato satisfaction per dollar.</li>
      <li><strong>Best for Sharing:</strong> <a href="/items/cheese-curds">Cheese Curds</a> and <a href="/items/pretzel-sticks-queso">Pretzel Sticks with Queso</a> ($3.99 each) are ideal center-table shareables for two to three diners.</li>
      <li><strong>Lightest Calorie Choice:</strong> The <a href="/items/side-salad">Side Salad</a> at just 90 calories provides a refreshing green alternative to fried sides.</li>
      <li><strong>Value Deal Eligibility:</strong> Both Regular Fries and Pretzel Sticks with Queso are frequently featured on the <a href="/items/2-for-5-mix-match">2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match</a> deal, letting you pair a premium hot snack with an entrée for just $5.00 flat.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Are DQ fries included with the Chicken Strip Basket?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Every Chicken Strip Basket (4-Piece, 6-Piece, and all Sauced varieties) includes seasoned fries, Texas toast, and a dipping sauce at no extra charge.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Are DQ Cheese Curds gluten-free?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">No. DQ Cheese Curds are battered in a seasoned wheat-flour coating and prepared in shared fryers, so they are not suitable for those with celiac disease or gluten sensitivities.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">
      For complete nutritional facts, full meal combos, and dessert pairings, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
